# AgentVision — things that must never be committed.
#
# Written after a pre-publish sweep found a 37 MB agentvision_debug.log, a
# bridge restart log and two profiles.json backups sitting in the tree, all
# full of one developer's absolute paths. None of it is source; all of it
# would have shipped.

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
agentvision_debug.log
bridge_restart.log

# Per-run state under log/. These are JSONL/JSON so `*.log` misses them, and
# they name the profiles the developer happened to be watching.
/log/observer/
/log/agentvision_baselines.json
/log/agentvision_push_mode.json
/log/agentvision_stop_blocks.json

# Captured frames, sidecars, thumbnails and archives. These are the user's
# screen contents — never publish them, and they are large.
snapshots/*/
!snapshots/README.txt
frames/
*.webp
*_annotated.png
*.diff

# ── Local state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# profiles.json holds the user's own program paths. The file ships with an empty
# object; a working copy will fill it in and that must stay local.
python_backend/profiles.json.bak*
python_backend/active_profile.txt
python_backend/connectors/adapters/user_adapters.json
# ...and its timestamped backups. The exact-file line above missed these, so two
# .bak copies of one developer's own adapter specs were in the shipping set.
python_backend/connectors/adapters/user_adapters.json.bak*
checkpoints/*/
!checkpoints/README.txt

# Bridge artifacts written INTO a target project (kept here in case AgentVision
# is ever run against its own tree).
#
# ANCHORED WITH A LEADING SLASH, and that is not a style choice. Unanchored,
# `sitecustomize.py` also matched agent_bootstrap/sitecustomize.py — the file
# CPython auto-loads to install every in-process hook. A clean clone would have
# shipped without the Python emitter and failed SILENTLY: no hooks, no error.
# Caught by `git check-ignore -v` before the first commit. Same trap on
# agentvision/, which would have matched any nested directory of that name.
/agentvision/
/sitecustomize.py
/.av_bridge_plan.json
/.av_preflight_ok

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/*.zip

# ── OS / editor ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Icon?
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# AgentVision diagnostic data (runtime, not config)
agentvision/actions.jsonl
agentvision/log.txt
agentvision/crashes/
agentvision/state.json
